        <div class="lg:col-span-7">
          <span
            class="inline-block px-4 py-1 rounded-full bg-brand-blue-fixed text-on-brand-blue-fixed text-label-md font-bold mb-6"
            >Our Core Services</span
          >
          <h1
            class="text-[3.5rem] leading-[1.1] font-extrabold text-brand-blue mb-8 tracking-tight"
          >
            Day Habilitation <br />
            <span class="text-brand-dark-yellow">(Day Services)</span>
          </h1>
          <p
            class="text-[1.25rem] leading-relaxed text-on-surface-variant max-w-2xl mb-8"
          >
            Another Step offers a unique approach to the provision of day
            supports for people with developmental disabilities. The agency
            provides all-day supports utilizing generic community resources.
          </p>
          <div
            class="flex items-center gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low max-w-lg"
          >
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-brand-red text-3xl"
              >domain_disabled</span
            >
            <p class="text-body-lg font-medium text-on-surface">
              There is no “center”, “program site”, or other types of artificial
              setting operated by our agency.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="lg:col-span-5 relative">
          <div class="rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl rotate-2">
            <img
              alt="Community member smiling in a bright cafe"
              class="w-full h-[500px] object-cover"
              data-alt="A diverse group of adults engaging in a lively conversation inside a modern sunlit library with large windows"
              src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuC2r82GJ7VHlZX74QRGi3AdpX3sJLiHWMOdnKnAJXJG0Ej3G7O75rRm8PsGhIl06fV9F6zwMtAY1m-qbJh59GIHqD5lZwpiek0SKy8NLJiGZGOn7XblDrvqnVbX81lXJEM7bPYldF1zg8XHuwxKIMMagfbRLXCsESCj-sOtSSuEZivn5wsHF_LRK77rSabPMWmkcdDqNSNM3tucZJ4wlr41fDIfdrmBHluAane6bczWyRuP5IB2GUNoE4SmCX4TWVPXmsO1O82uAmU"
            />
          </div>
          Decorative element
          <div
            class="absolute -bottom-6 -left-6 w-32 h-32 bg-brand-yellow rounded-xl -z-10"
          >
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section> -->
  <!-- Deep Dive Section (Asymmetric Editorial Layout) -->
  <section class="py-24 bg-surface-container-low">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-8">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-20 items-start">
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-headline-lg font-bold text-on-surface mb-12 relative">
            Beyond Traditional Settings
            <div
              class="absolute -bottom-4 left-0 w-24 h-2 bg-brand-dark-red rounded-full"
            >
            </div>
          </h2>
          <div
            class="space-y-6 text-body-lg leading-loose text-on-surface-variant"
          >
            <p>
              Another Step offers a unique approach to the provision of day
              supports for people with developmental disabilities. The agency
              provides all-day supports utilizing generic community resources.
              There is no “center”, “program site”, or other types of artificial
              setting operated by the agency. ​
            </p>
            <p>
              Staff at Another Step structure the use of <span
                class="font-bold text-on-surface"
                >college facilities, libraries, coffee shops, gyms</span
              >, and numerous other community resources to support people in
              being full members of their community.
            </p>
            <p>
              Skill development occurs at the time and place the skill would
              normally be used. Volunteering is encouraged as a means of
              developing relationships, being viewed as a valued member of the
              community, and building skills.
            </p>
            <p
              class="italic text-primary font-medium border-l-4 border-brand-blue pl-6 py-2"
            >
              All services are delivered in small groups to insure they are
              individualized to the wants and needs of each person.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 pt-12">
          <div class="space-y-4">
            <div class="aspect-square rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-lg">
              <img
                alt="People laughing at a community center"
                class="w-full h-full object-cover"
                data-alt="A close up shot of hands engaged in a collaborative community gardening project in a vibrant public park"
                src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuCl4NyYYeWlZdmrROIhMeN5j18R9eYrIGOAAgUlOxYB-2Gii6SAPWaY4mT9kforQln2zJ4tFPoeTWvuz7f51MOHCYTtMSyi9iz0g-mOXFz6pLHi2UhK74Tnyc23Xvsg8ZvghTCet8_p7dbMGvIYx5CxmFVfhYLt7gJMPt6R0wXWm3l_-HLlpBepps1kxOsWvpOU8LPhezVRalVNS9kJ48yK2aQXTub3VWNXSHamhdOKAEmmJCSGgLiv5ZG7taBEny4yCa20BP4eLWM"
              />
            </div>
            <div class="bg-brand-red p-8 rounded-xl text-on-brand-red">
              <div class="text-4xl font-extrabold mb-2">100%</div>
              <div class="text-label-md font-bold uppercase tracking-widest">
                Community Integrated
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="space-y-4 translate-y-12">
            <div
              class="bg-brand-blue-container p-8 rounded-xl"
            >
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-4xl text-on-brand-color mb-4">groups</span
              >
              <div class="text-title-lg text-on-brand-color font-bold leading-tight">
                Small, Focused Groups
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="aspect-[3/4] rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-lg">
              <img
                alt="People interacting in a public space"
                class="w-full h-full object-cover"
                data-alt="A small group of friends smiling and interacting with a local vendor at an outdoor community farmers market"
                src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuBvSftf7lIfoZXAegSirB5H4f2yUBrUkwtigY7m82mwSpGi7tLQBy2ef7ucmg52ErsSANpJ-0kgtBfrBrrpOUTHpQtyhYwYFHPHZN9ohIxapney2nSBSnDsjGpSproLwsr6ot7-oOzvdwwA7UqkbLd4Qfjir0Y8diiDjd1opPxB0SejT6VO028G2rta88mMwBQSymmkLlaOeOK5Q7-kTx7HO6o0KHJkjKZPT8kJUeVwS1TvnRpYjfrhIdVyYx2TRpSkSfR0EEcsrKQ"
              />
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <!-- Key Points (Bento Grid) -->
  <section class="py-32">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-8">
      <div class="mb-16 text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        <h2 class="text-headline-lg font-bold text-on-surface mb-4">
          The Another Step Experience
        </h2>
        <p class="text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant">
          We've reimagined day services to prioritize independence and personal
          growth through community engagement.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        <!-- Point 1 -->
        <div
          class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-10 rounded-xl shadow-[0_16px_32px_rgba(0,0,0,0.04)] hover:-translate-y-2 transition-transform border-b-8 border-brand-blue"
        >
          <div
            class="w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-brand-blue-fixed flex items-center justify-center mb-8"
          >
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-brand-blue text-3xl"
              >directions_bus</span
            >
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-title-lg font-bold text-on-surface mb-4">
            Door-to-Door Support
          </h3>
          <p class="text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
            We pick participants up at home in the morning and drop them off at
            the end of the day.
          </p>
        </div>
        <!-- Point 2 -->
        <div
          class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-10 rounded-xl shadow-[0_16px_32px_rgba(0,0,0,0.04)] hover:-translate-y-2 transition-transform border-b-8 border-brand-red"
        >
          <div
            class="w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-brand-red-fixed flex items-center justify-center mb-8"
          >
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-brand-red text-3xl"
              >calendar_today</span
            >
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-title-lg font-bold text-on-surface mb-4">
            Meaningful Schedules
          </h3>
          <p class="text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
            We develop and implement a meaningful schedule of activities based on the participant’s individual preferences and needs tha are delivered 100% in the community.
          </p>
        </div>
        <!-- Point 3 -->
        <div
          class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-10 rounded-xl shadow-[0_16px_32px_rgba(0,0,0,0.04)] hover:-translate-y-2 transition-transform border-b-8 border-brand-dark-yellow"
        >
          <div
            class="w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-brand-yellow flex items-center justify-center mb-8"
          >
            <span
              class="material-symbols-outlined text-on-brand-yellow text-3xl"
              >volunteer_activism</span
            >
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-title-lg font-bold text-on-surface mb-4">
            Continuous Feedback
          </h3>
          <p class="text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
            We listen to people and make adjustments to the program based on the
            feedback of participants.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <!-- Contact Section -->
  <section class="py-24 bg-surface">
    <div class="max-w-screen-2xl mx-auto px-8">
      <div
        class="bg-surface-container p-12 md:p-20 rounded-xl relative overflow-hidden"
      >
        <!-- Background Accent -->
        <div
          class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-1/3 h-full opacity-10 pointer-events-none"
        >
          <svg
            class="h-full w-full"
            viewbox="0 0 200 200"
            xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
          >
            <path
              d="M44.7,-76.4C58.1,-69.2,69.2,-58.1,76.4,-44.7C83.7,-31.3,87.1,-15.7,87.1,0C87.1,15.7,83.7,31.3,76.4,44.7C69.2,58.1,58.1,69.2,44.7,76.4C31.3,83.7,15.7,87.1,0,87.1C-15.7,87.1,-31.3,83.7,-44.7,76.4C-58.1,69.2,-69.2,58.1,-76.4,44.7C-83.7,31.3,-87.1,15.7,-87.1,0C-87.1,-15.7,-83.7,-31.3,-76.4,-44.7C-69.2,-58.1,-58.1,-69.2,-44.7,-76.4C-31.3,-83.7,-15.7,-87.1,0,-87.1C15.7,-87.1,31.3,-83.7,44.7,-76.4Z"
              fill="#004E8B"
              transform="translate(100 100)"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div
          class="relative z-10 grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center"
        >
          <div>
            <h2
              class="text-[3rem] font-extrabold text-brand-blue leading-tight mb-6"
            >
              Connect with us
            </h2>
            <p class="text-xl text-on-surface-variant mb-12">
              Have questions about our Day Services? Reach out directly to our leadership team for assistance.
            </p>
            <div class="mt-12 flex gap-4">
              <button class="bg-brand-blue text-on-brand-blue px-10 py-4 rounded-full font-bold text-body-lg shadow-lg hover:bg-brand-blue-container transition-all">Schedule a Call</button>
              <button class="border-2 border-outline-variant px-10 py-4 rounded-full font-bold text-body-lg hover:bg-surface-container-low transition-all">Email Us</button>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div
            class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-10 rounded-xl shadow-xl border-l-8 border-brand-red"
          >
            <div class="flex items-start gap-6">
              <div
                class="w-24 h-24 rounded-full bg-surface-container-high flex-shrink-0 overflow-hidden"
              >
                <img
                  class="w-full h-full object-cover"
                  alt="Mary Lattari" 
                  data-alt="Professional portrait of a kind, middle-aged woman with a warm smile, wearing a professional navy blazer in a modern office"
                  src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuBigPaLRn9BG0RnwmVtVT_QGBACCFNi50Cb7mCCslWCUcsSdi7O34Zd99HiYQcMNMnSCzq-4WnyuRcGtgX_n9N0opwHl11mCRIdoVirOS5itZJpbICbIRcHda9eTmbwUesJzETo5bbZS_w9G3UmtJ2b0KNauLmOGABWabiz7Hn_fXTEh_hi2sx6V2ItojsDuRxcoUbFJFKn7G_4XS6O8M9XYL4JFRE9HbdGINiZxXWcz5629OH7zsnzuZHP49ijqvPIPhbcKxa6hcA"
                />
              </div>
              <div>
                <h4 class="text-2xl font-bold text-on-surface">Mary Lattari</h4>
                <p
                  class="text-brand-red font-medium uppercase tracking-wider text-sm mb-4"
                >
                  Director Day Services
                </p>
                <div class="space-y-3">
                  <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-on-surface-variant">
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-brand-blue"
                      >location_on</span
                    >
                    <span>Rockland &amp; Westchester County</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-on-surface-variant">
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-brand-blue"
                      >call</span
                    >
                    <span class="font-bold text-on-surface">(914) 946-2288</span
                    >
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</MainLayout>
